{
  "abstract": "Lean proofs of Yongxi Lin's original weak type (1,1) bounds: c_2 >= 1.6855 and c_2 <= 3.879 for cubes, c_2 <= e for Euclidean discs, and c_n <= (n/2)^(n/(n-2)) for balls in n >= 3. Also proves the classical cube bound c_d <= 2^d.",
